        <p>0 IP . „ .-. (Regd. Trade Mark.) . . , , C 0 IFFEE EZSIENCE, ' .. The Coffee Maid, of Syminston's, says: "My motto is: 'Keep the kettle boiling !'— ..., Then I can always have a cup of Symington' instantly." , .. TWOS. SIXINGTON &amp; CO., Edifiburgla and London.</p>
