        <p>Deaths.</p>
        <p>GROVES.—On April lgth, at 361, Winwick-road, Agnes Groves, aged 85 years. WALMSLEY.—On April 11th, at 7, Norman-street, Sarah Walmsley, aged 27 years.</p>
