        <p>To repair a car just as good as it can be repaired</p>
        <p>We claim that such a policy furnishes the starting point to convince those owners who are</p>
        <p>experiencing car trouble of the value of our service</p>
        <p>The most important part of every business is to know what ought to be done.—Columdla</p>
