      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-04-17_WidnesExaminer_art0309" n="art0309">
        <head>SALES BY AUCTION</head>
        <p>SALES BY AUCTION</p>
        <p>HENRY TAYLOR.</p>
        <p>.4.UCTIONEER AND VALUER.</p>
        <p>'STATE &amp; INSURANCE AGENT. 15. BOLD-STREET. WARRINGTON. Tel. 228.</p>
