        <p>CHARMING Old Black and White House, fine old barn, small cottage, garden and meadow, in all 6 acres; Tunbridge Wells 4 miles; rent X 56; freehold R1,500.—W. Mockford, 21, Frant-road, 'Tunbridge Wells _ MO LET, Villas, Wlutefield-road ; £26 and £3O. —Apply A. Mounfield,_l6,_Church-street. TO BE LET, three Spacious Shops, with good dwelling-houses to each; recently erected at the foot of.the New Bridge, Knutsford-road.—For particulars apply J. Lulit e Foot,.Warrinstun-</p>
