        <p>RGENTS WANTED.—The Reliance Lubri- catingating Oil Co. (Old Real-British Firm), Water- lane, Great Tower-street, London, B.C. refiners and blenders " Autoleum " Motor Car Oils, " Ajax" Greases, Marine and Land Engine and Machinery Oils, " Astrat " Disinfectants, Turpentine Substi- tutes, Asbestos Packing, etc.—Write Secretary. DRESSMAKING.—GOOd—Bodice and Coat Hands Wanted, also good Improver.—Apply E. Warburton, 82, Buttermarket-street, Warring- ton.</p>
