        <p>SLIGHTLY.WOUNDED.</p>
        <p>The following men have also been reported wounded, but not seriously enough to be ad- mitted to hospital :- 2501, Private W. Rimmer, "C" Company.— Abrasion on the left side of the forehead, caused by bullet fragments; March 27th. 2050, Private J. Bond, “B" Company.—An abrasion on the left arm, caused by fragments of a bullet; March 28th. '</p>
